# ==========================================
# CREIDYLL: Tethered Hover Shoe Core Control
# Target: Lattice iCE40 Up5k (Asynchronous Spatial Fabric)
# ==========================================

# 1. DETERMINISTIC BOOT (The Spine)
spine the clock to vertical_mode for init
spine the clock to speed_selector for init

# 2. CONSTANTS AND PARAMETERS
set SAFE_DESCENT_SPEED to 2 m/s
set NORMAL_WALK_SPEED to 1.4 m/s
set MAX_TILT_ANGLE to 15 degrees
set U_TURN_SPEED to 3 m/s

# 3. CONTROL INPUTS (From Pad via Tether)
make a memory named speed_selector with size 16
make a neuron named right_stick_press with threshold 1 and leak 0
make a neuron named right_stick_backward_hold with threshold 1 and leak 0
make a neuron named nav_forward with threshold 1 and leak 0
make a neuron named nav_backward with threshold 1 and leak 0
make a neuron named nav_left with threshold 1 and leak 0
make a neuron named nav_right with threshold 1 and leak 0

# 4. SHOE-MOUNTED SAFETY INPUT
make a neuron named shoe_emergency_button with threshold 1 and leak 0

# 5. STATE MACHINES
make a state_machine named vertical_mode with states idle, ascend, hover, descend
make a state_machine named navigation_mode with states stopped, forward, backward, left, right, u_turn

# 6. STATE TRANSITIONS
on press right_stick_press transition from idle to ascend in vertical_mode
on press right_stick_press transition from ascend to hover in vertical_mode
on press right_stick_press transition from hover to descend in vertical_mode
on press right_stick_press transition from descend to idle in vertical_mode

on press nav_forward transition from stopped to forward in navigation_mode
on press nav_backward transition from stopped to backward in navigation_mode
on press nav_left transition from stopped to left in navigation_mode
on press nav_right transition from stopped to right in navigation_mode
on press right_stick_backward_hold transition from stopped to u_turn in navigation_mode

# 7. EMERGENCY OVERRIDES
if shoe_emergency_button pressed then force vertical_mode to descend immediately

# 8. SECURE FLIGHT BUS (Metamorphic Obfuscation)
make a metamorphic router named secure_control_bus with key 8'hA1
morph the spike from right_stick_press through secure_control_bus to vertical_mode with key 8'hA1
morph the spike from shoe_emergency_button through secure_control_bus to vertical_mode with key 8'hB2
morph the spike from nav_forward through secure_control_bus to navigation_mode with key 8'hC3

# 9. ASYNC ACTUATOR OUTPUT
make a neuron named thruster_left with threshold 5 and leak 1
make a neuron named thruster_right with threshold 5 and leak 1

flow the spike from vertical_mode into the read of thruster_left
flow the spike from navigation_mode into the read of thruster_right

start the system
